[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3737468559","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113228#issuecomment-3737468559","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113228","id":3737468559,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7exT6P","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-12T08:55:22Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T09:14:18Z","body":"> [!IMPORTANT]\r\n> This PR also fixes a bug (eliminates an inconsistency between `Array` and packed arrays) that some users may consider a breaking change:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar a: Array = [1]:\r\n    set(v):\r\n        prints(\"set a\", v)\r\n        a = v\r\n    get:\r\n        prints(\"get a\")\r\n        return a\r\n\r\nvar b: PackedByteArray = [1]:\r\n    set(v):\r\n        prints(\"set b\", v)\r\n        b = v\r\n    get:\r\n        prints(\"get b\")\r\n        return b\r\n\r\nvar c: PackedVector2Array = [Vector2.ONE]:\r\n    set(v):\r\n        prints(\"set c\", v)\r\n        c = v\r\n    get:\r\n        prints(\"get c\")\r\n        return c\r\n\r\nfunc _run() -> void:\r\n    a[0] = 2\r\n    print(a)\r\n    b[0] = 2\r\n    print(b)\r\n    c[0].x = 2\r\n    print(c)\r\n```\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\n```\r\nget a\r\nget a\r\n[2]\r\nget b\r\nset b [2]\r\nget b\r\n[2]\r\nget c\r\nset c [(2.0, 1.0)]\r\nget c\r\n[(2.0, 1.0)]\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\n```\r\nget a\r\nget a\r\n[2]\r\nget b\r\nget b\r\n[2]\r\nget c\r\nget c\r\n[(2.0, 1.0)]\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3737468559/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3768520241","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113228#issuecomment-3768520241","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113228","id":3768520241,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gnw4x","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-19T14:08:55Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T14:08:55Z","body":"Since these methods aren't used anywhere outside of GDScript, it seems fairly safe to change their behavior. I'm not sure what semantics are implied by the term \"shared\". Maybe it makes sense to rename the static method to `is_reference_type()`, since that terminology is used in the `is_same()` [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_%40globalscope.html#class-globalscope-method-is-same). But this is a less appropriate choice for the non-static counterpart of the method, compared to `is_shared()`.\r\n\r\nOn the other hand, perhaps we worry too much about terminology. We can call packed arrays shared types in Godot's type system, inside `Variant` (it is a `Variant` method, after all), even if this isn't correct outside `Variant`. Just like the GDScript `float` type (`Variant::FLOAT`) actually corresponds to the C++ `double`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3768520241/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3801314270","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113228#issuecomment-3801314270","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113228","id":3801314270,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ik3Pe","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T19:20:42Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T19:20:42Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3801314270/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]